  <item>
    <title>EP.011｜养猫让我重新认识自己，勇敢爱自己！｜520特辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6641c3477096082641c743e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6641c3477096082641c743e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 20:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍃无论我们在何种情况下做了和猫相处的决定，</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许本质上都是进入了一段关系；</span></p><span></span><p><span>过程中我们诉说彼此，我们依赖彼此，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们照见彼此，我们也滋养彼此……</span></p><span></span><p><span>养猫给生活增加了重量和尺度，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们跟随着它，亦步亦趋，收录沿途的风景，收获沉重的行囊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐱毡毛时间🐱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> 第一次感觉它Buff叠满了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 一只养熟的老猫决定不告而别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 和猫相处的模式反映到原生家庭的相处模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> 在权力范围内不为难别人是一种善意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 开始觉得这是一种庞大的责任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> 大家开心才是真的开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 某种程度上对猫付出是在和小时候的自己对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a> 人类只会和小猫心甘情愿地低姿态相处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3032">50:32</a> 和它相处带给我温柔、包容与幸福的烦恼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3299">54:59</a> 猫让生活回归生活本身</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩，请收听本期内容！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤本期主播：大屋/蹦蹦/桐桐</span></p><span></span><p><span>✂️剪辑：有有</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：这是我一生中最勇敢的瞬间-清晨大攀</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏欢迎订阅@一身猫毛</span><br><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63423511000000001901c30f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63423511000000001901c30f&amp;apptime=1714290067" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63423511000000001901c30f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63423511000000001901c30f&amp;apptime=1714290067"><span>一身猫毛Studio</span></a><br><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/OwbWmc" data-url="https://okjk.co/OwbWmc"><span>一身猫毛Studio</span></a></p>]]></description>
