    <guid isPermaLink="false">662e033f5fb33c1b2b157cb8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Apr 2024 08:05:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎁送礼物不仅是一种表达情感的方式，更是一门艺术。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在选择和送出礼物时，你是不是特别苦恼头疼？</span></p><span></span><p><span>小众｜走心｜实用｜造物之美｜提高幸福指数</span></p><span></span><p><span>尤其面对你「不会说话」的宠物主子时</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何使礼物更加高效而有意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐱毡毛时间🐱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 猫猫朋友：维仔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 很ooooooook的第一份礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 原来宠物也有自己的阿贝贝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 紧身衣和oversize其实是挑错尺码？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">08:27</a> 养宠人的必经之路——DIY</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 让“设计师”最满意的DIY礼物竟然是</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 吃吐蛋糕让我意识到：爱TA应该陪TA做TA喜欢的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a> 提高幸福指数，强推养宠人都去买的礼物：床头猫爬架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 爱你的人永远知道怎么爱你</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩，请收听本期内容！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤本期主播：有有/珊珊</span></p><span></span><p><span>✂️剪辑：有有</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：仙乐处处飘-Lil' Ashes</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏欢迎订阅@一身猫毛</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63423511000000001901c30f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63423511000000001901c30f&amp;apptime=1714290067" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63423511000000001901c30f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63423511000000001901c30f&amp;apptime=1714290067"><span>一身猫毛Studio</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/OwbWmc" data-url="https://okjk.co/OwbWmc"><span>一身猫毛Studio</span></a></p>]]></description>
