    <guid isPermaLink="false">6566942536f7c4e74efd769b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Nov 2023 01:30:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：有有 / CC / 夏笙</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一门听起来略显古怪的生意</span></p><span></span><p><span>摆荡于真实与玄妙之间</span></p><span></span><p><span>「宠物沟通师」们声称不仅可以探听宠物的心声</span></p><span></span><p><span>还能辅助主人矫正宠物的行为问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>甚至可以帮助人们寻回走失的猫猫和狗狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们是如何探究宠物的内心世界呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>My Sharona-The Knack-40 Hits 1975 - 1979</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lullaby-Raimond Lap-BABY CLASSICS</span></p>]]></description>
