  <item>
    <title>EP.003｜「留影计划」聪明女人教你如何用猫，一招搞定老妈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6528f9a850cf691d247c981f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6528f9a850cf691d247c981f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Oct 2023 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「简介」</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听本期节目！本期节目是「留影计划」系列的第二期故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「留影计划」活动，是一身猫毛和开玩时刻共同发起的一次记录活动，让养猫人与猫、与生活、与时代产生连接，用心去感受初见的美好和陪伴的静谧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>养了猫咪以后，我终于理解为什么很多妈妈的相册里都是孩子的照片，对于我来说，猫咪就是我的孩子，我也开始有了老母亲的心态，相册里都是猫的照片，频繁记录着他们从小到大的生长历程，生怕错过一点什么。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「留影计划」第二期，范范同学将和我们分享“聪明女人教你如何用猫，一招搞定老妈”的故事，妈妈一开始的无声拒绝，到后来的接受、再到溺爱的转变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「时间轴」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 世上只有妈妈好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 独一无二的起名经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 北漂女生的真实生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 为数不多的忤逆，背着妈妈养猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 我把猫挂上了‘二手平台’</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 托运宠物猫，真的靠谱吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> ‘白月光’的威力在于无人能敌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 北漂的尽头是买猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 要二胎是为了给一胎找个伴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> 慢慢求医路，只有经历的人才知道有多累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 想不明白千万别要二胎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 聪明女人教你如何用猫，一招搞定老妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 被宠溺的泰迪狗吃饭也上餐桌了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 当我和我妈的“育儿”理念冲突了，该怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 过敏妈妈接受不了我的猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 话唠旺仔逐渐获得我妈的芳心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a> 来自老妈的偏爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 从此世界多了一位很爱你们的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩，请收听本期内容！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgrJjH7on_c4Wx3mCVzh9MO69biV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi8RF1ZwPM8WWhf7ndAoPVAs7wIQ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu_83hDhV4IGVa6AWZN_8ItkHl4A.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlPeoHDdWVr8w2ZQhgOIN3U8OjDW.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvqkPl-ljygdGbTUs8-iW9rLNjkm.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llA1rZg8rfHjU6eeS39gGkJXCcTB.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvQUI7LDArZ-ORcYL-VFickRj6eW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>「本期节目使用音乐」</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：“Slow”，by 落日飞车，from Cassa Nova</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：“Slow”，by 落日飞车，from Cassa Nova</span></p><span></span><p><span>「关于一身猫毛」</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家收听，你可以在微信和微博搜索「一身猫毛Studio」，关注我们，还可以通过小宇宙、苹果播客、网易云音乐、喜马拉雅、荔枝FM、汽水儿客户端收听我们的节目，下期再见。</span></p>]]></description>
